  {
   "approach": "Start at the Bear Lake trailhead and follow the trail past Dream Lake to Emerald Lake, roughly 1.7 to 1.8 miles one way. From the lake, follow the climbers' trail above and around its south shore to the foot of the north face of Hallett Peak. Aim for the western edge of the Third Buttress, which forms the right skyline of the north face. The route starts near that edge, below the tall, vertical V-groove of the second pitch. Snow slopes below the face can slide, so check the avalanche forecast.",
