  {
   "approach": "Start at the Bear Lake trailhead and follow the trail past Dream Lake to Emerald Lake, roughly 1.7 to 1.8 miles one way. From the lake, follow the climbers' trail above and around its south shore to the foot of the north face of Hallett Peak. The route starts up the prominent dihedral of the First Buttress. Snow slopes at its base can be prone to avalanche. Snow slopes below the face can slide, so check the avalanche forecast.",
