  {
   "approach": "Start at the Bear Lake trailhead and follow the trail past Dream Lake to Emerald Lake, roughly 1.7 to 1.8 miles one way. From the lake, follow the climbers' trail above and around its south shore to the foot of the north face of Hallett Peak. Hallett Chimney splits the north side of the peak, separating the First Buttress from the Second. The chimney funnels falling rock and ice, so do not linger below parties above. Snow slopes below the face can slide, so check the avalanche forecast.",
