  {
   "approach": "Start at the Bear Lake trailhead and follow the trail past Dream Lake to Emerald Lake, roughly 1.7 to 1.8 miles one way. From the lake, follow the climbers' trail above and around its south shore to the foot of the north face of Hallett Peak. The Slit is the obvious gash between the Second and Third Buttresses. Snow slopes below the face can slide, so check the avalanche forecast.",
